[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_7D7ccWLVsdEoNjDJdk9yFeEp","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"83759","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md","name":"pushbutton.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<pushbutton />`\n\nPushbuttons a common type of switch normally open momentary switch. They are commonly used as a reset or pairing button.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <pushbutton\n      name=\"SW1\"\n      footprint=\"pushbutton\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `name`, `footprint`, `connections`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [PushButtonProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#pushbuttonprops-pushbutton)\n- Source: [lib/components/push-button.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/push-button.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ebe-3350-7570-90f8-ccea92f86cdd","turnId":"019e8ebe-335b-7063-9c14-de69357ce45c","completedAtMs":1780511392849}}
[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_l3SKsuBWDJln08wR6aPdMeSD","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,160p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"13306","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,160p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md","name":"crystal.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<crystal />`\n\nA crystal oscillator provides a stable clock signal essential for timing applications and microcontroller operations.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"50mm\" height=\"50mm\">\n    <crystal\n      name=\"XT1\"\n      frequency=\"16MHz\"\n      loadCapacitance=\"18pF\"\n      footprint=\"hc49\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `frequency`, `loadCapacitance`, `manufacturerPartNumber`, `mpn`, `pinVariant`, `schOrientation`, `connections`, `name`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [CrystalProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#crystalprops-crystal)\n- Source: [lib/components/crystal.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/crystal.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/crystal.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/crystal.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ebe-3350-7570-90f8-ccea92f86cdd","turnId":"019e8ebe-335b-7063-9c14-de69357ce45c","completedAtMs":1780511392849}}
