[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_05838b0b48fabf37016a20765ec1088195af2884da6f7d1f04","text":"Implemented the RP2040 USB breakout in [index.circuit.tsx](/workspace/index.circuit.tsx).\n\nWhat’s included:\n- JLCPCB-imported `RP2040`, USB-C receptacle, AP2112K 3.3 V regulator, and W25Q16 flash under [imports/](/workspace/imports)\n- USB-C VBUS, D+/D-, CC pulldowns, 3.3 V regulation\n- QSPI flash, 12 MHz crystal, decoupling, RUN pullup\n- GPIO25 status LED\n- Two 10-pin breakout headers: GPIO0-GPIO11, SWD, RUN, BOOTSEL, VBUS, 3V3, GND\n- Routing enabled; no `routingDisabled` usage\n\nValidation run:\n- `bun run typecheck` passed\n- `tsci check netlist index.circuit.tsx` passed with 0 errors/warnings\n- `tsci check placement index.circuit.tsx` passed with 0 errors/warnings\n- `tsci build index.circuit.tsx` completed successfully and wrote `dist/index/circuit.json`\n\nBuild still prints non-fatal metadata warnings about generic built-in LED/header supplier-footprint matching and missing `pinAttributes` on imported chips, but it ends with `✓ Done`.\n\n**TSCircuit Developer Feedback**\n- Confusing/surprising: JLCPCB imports worked well, but imported parts had no `pinAttributes`, which caused noisy build warnings even after the electrical netlist was clean.\n- Most time wasted: autorouting feedback. A failing or slow route took a long time to surface, and high effort settings could look like a hang.\n- Helpful docs/API changes: clearer footprint strings for common crystals, clearer guidance on build warnings vs actual failures, and examples for RP2040-class routed boards.\n- Specific friction points: `solderjumper` produced unroutable port-coordinate warnings, schematic placement reports treated verbose net-label suggestions as “issues,” and generic built-in LED/header parts triggered supplier footprint mismatch warnings.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e8ebe-3350-7570-90f8-ccea92f86cdd","turnId":"019e8ebe-335b-7063-9c14-de69357ce45c","completedAtMs":1780512358525}}
